            <span><kbd>Tab</kbd> focus controls and hand</span>
            <span><kbd>Ctrl+Z</kbd> undo (this turn)</span>
            <span><kbd>L</kbd> history of recent actions</span>
            <span><kbd>F6</kbd> pass until your turn</span>
            <span>Hold <kbd>Space</kbd> skip ahead on opponents’ turns</span>
            <span><kbd>C</kbd> commander damage</span>
            <span><kbd>Shift+G</kbd>/<kbd>Shift+X</kbd> your graveyard / exile</span>
            <span><kbd>R</kbd> rules</span>
            <span><kbd>P</kbd> screenshot</span>
            <span><kbd>G</kbd> fullscreen</span>
            <span><kbd>?</kbd> this help</span>
